---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import story from '../../../../../kb/research/culture/huluhuli-website.json';
---
<Shell title={story.title} description={story.lead} active="explore" wide related={false}>
<article class="wrap huluhuli-story"><a class="text-link collection-return" href="/sounds-of-odisha/#huluhuli">← Sounds of Odisha</a>
<header class="huluhuli-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Sounds of Odisha · ହୁଳହୁଳି</p><h1>Huluhuli.<br/><em>A voice of welcome.</em></h1><p class="lead">{story.lead}</p></div><figure><img src="/images/sounds/huluhuli-welcome.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt={story.photo.alt} fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>{story.photo.caption}</figcaption></figure></header>
<div class="huluhuli-reading">{story.blocks.map(b=><section>{b.title&&<h2>{b.title}</h2>}{b.items.length>0&&<ul>{b.items.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ul>}{b.paragraphs.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}</section>)}
<p class="notice">A sourced reader story. Practitioner/language review remains open; no audio recording or current performance booking is provided.</p>
<p><a href="/literature/">Explore Odia literature →</a> · <a href="/sounds-of-odisha/#dhemsa">Meet Dhemsa →</a></p>
<details class="utk-disclosure huluhuli-credits"><summary>Sources, artwork &amp; reading notes</summary><p>{story.limits} Desk review: {story.reviewed_on}.</p><ul>{story.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.resource}>{s.title}</a></li>)}</ul><p>The 2022 festival description and 2015 competition account retain indexed-source limits. The personal cultural essay is attributed context; the publisher synopsis is comparative reading, not diffusion evidence. Origin and literary-edition research remain open.</p><h3>Artwork</h3><p>{story.photo.provenance} {story.photo.changes}</p></details>
<p><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fsounds-of-odisha%2Fhuluhuli%2F">Suggest a correction or a public source</a>. GitHub submissions are public; omit private contact details and consent documents.</p><a class="text-link" href="/sounds-of-odisha/">Continue the listening journey →</a></div>
</article></Shell>
<style>.huluhuli-story{padding-bottom:70px}.collection-return{display:inline-block;margin:28px 0}.huluhuli-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,100px);align-items:center;margin:12px 0 52px}.huluhuli-hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,84px);line-height:1.08}.huluhuli-hero h1 em{color:var(--sea)}.huluhuli-hero figure{margin:0}.huluhuli-hero img{width:100%;height:auto}.huluhuli-hero figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.huluhuli-reading{max-width:900px;margin:auto;font-size:19px;line-height:1.85}.huluhuli-reading section{margin-bottom:40px}.huluhuli-reading h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,44px);line-height:1.2;margin:36px 0 18px}.huluhuli-reading li{margin:12px 0}.huluhuli-credits{font-size:16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:30px 0}.huluhuli-credits li{margin:10px 0}@media(max-width:760px){.huluhuli-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.huluhuli-hero h1{font-size:46px}.huluhuli-reading{font-size:17px}.huluhuli-reading section{margin-bottom:28px}}</style>
